10:08.400 --> 10:11.490
<b>Oh. It looks like Kugasaki 
has already picked up the 5.</b>

10:12.010 --> 10:15.060
<b><i>He may have been lucky 
and started close to it.</i></b>

10:15.060 --> 10:19.720
<b><i>But he likely knows about the Display Bug
 by now. I wonder how he will proceed.</i></b>

10:21.090 --> 10:22.380
<b>Himeji, what's wrong?</b>

10:23.070 --> 10:27.470
<b><i>Um, it appears Kugasaki-sama 
just picked up his second card.</i></b>

10:27.470 --> 10:28.390
<b>Huh?</b>

10:28.740 --> 10:32.390
<b>That's strange. The number of cards
 displayed hasn't changed yet.</b>

10:32.670 --> 10:37.130
<b><i>He likely picked up a card with a number
 and coordinates as yet unrevealed.</i></b>

10:37.130 --> 10:40.080
<b>Wait. Does that mean 
he's using the Explore ability?</b>

10:40.840 --> 10:42.780
<b><i>If he knew the locations from the start,</i></b>

10:42.780 --> 10:45.600
<b><i>picking up a card that hasn't
been revealed yet makes sense.</i></b>

10:45.600 --> 10:49.290
<b><i>But if you don't know the card's value,
going to it would waste time.</i></b>

10:50.200 --> 10:52.270
<b>Wait, did he ditch
Numerical Adjustment—</b>

10:52.720 --> 10:55.290
<b><i>Oh? Looks like you have 
some game sense, after all.</i></b>

10:55.600 --> 10:59.770
<b>Kugasaki? How did you... 
You don't know what my ID is.</b>

11:00.090 --> 11:03.990
<b><i>The Black Wings ability is useful 
for more than just stage effects.</i></b>

11:04.280 --> 11:08.000
<b><i>I can use it to transmit 
my voice from far away.</i></b>

11:08.780 --> 11:12.190
<b>Huh. If you're just calling 
to brag, I'll hang up.</b>

11:12.190 --> 11:14.290
<b><i>Let me impart some wisdom on you.</i></b>

11:14.290 --> 11:16.950
<b><i>You are making a fundamental mistake.</i></b>

11:16.950 --> 11:17.770
<b>Huh?</b>

11:17.770 --> 11:21.820
<b><i>At this rate, the game will end
 in absolute victory to me.</i></b>

11:22.520 --> 11:25.280
<b><i>Well then, Shinohara. Two seconds left.</i></b>

11:25.640 --> 11:27.040
<b>Two seconds?</b>

11:27.990 --> 11:30.770
<b><i>The game's only been
 going for five minutes.</i></b>

11:30.770 --> 11:33.480
<b><i>Wait. Five minutes? 
Something's wrong.</i></b>

11:33.480 --> 11:35.630
<b><i>One more card should've been revealed.</i></b>

11:35.630 --> 11:38.040
<b><i>But there isn't any 
new card information yet.</i></b>

11:35.630 --> 11:38.050
<b></b>Search Here

11:38.340 --> 11:38.380
<b>Collection Phase</b>

11:38.340 --> 11:38.380
<b>Kugasaki Seiran</b>

11:38.340 --> 11:38.380
<b>Shinohara Hiroto</b>

11:38.380 --> 11:47.810
<b>Collection Phase</b>

11:38.380 --> 11:47.810
<b>Kugasaki Seiran</b>

11:38.380 --> 11:47.810
<b>Shinohara Hiroto</b>

11:38.680 --> 11:40.420
<b><i>What could this mean?</i></b>

11:40.420 --> 11:44.780
<b><i>There has been nothing to indicate 
that Kugasaki-sama has picked up the 10.</i></b>

11:44.780 --> 11:47.810
<b><i>And why did the other mystery card disappear?</i></b>

11:48.630 --> 11:51.720
<b>No. It didn't disappear. 
Its info has been revealed.</b>

11:51.720 --> 11:54.150
<b>So the card whose value
was unknown so far...</b>

11:54.150 --> 11:56.030
<b><i>...has just been revealed to be the 10?</i></b>

11:56.030 --> 11:56.810
<b>Damn it!</b>

11:56.810 --> 12:00.940
<b>It looked like I wasn't getting new info, 
but that was it! That was the reveal!</b>

12:01.520 --> 12:05.750
<b>Kugasaki's planning on looking up all
the card locations and picking them all up.</b>

12:05.750 --> 12:09.070
<b>At this rate, I'll never get any new info.</b>

12:09.780 --> 12:10.780
<b><i>Surely not!</i></b>

12:10.780 --> 12:11.500
<b>It's true.</b>

12:11.500 --> 12:16.080
<b>He's trying to get 18 out of 20 cards
in the collection phase to secure victory.</b>

12:17.510 --> 12:21.740
<b><i>Master, the bus Kagaya-san is 
driving has apparently been blocked.</i></b>

12:21.740 --> 12:22.510
<b>What?</b>

12:22.510 --> 12:26.770
<b><i>Hotrods with Self-Made Knights markings 
have been racing around District 4,</i></b>

12:26.770 --> 12:29.040
<b><i>and the police have mobilized to stop them.</i></b>

12:29.520 --> 12:31.820
<b>Must be Emergency Mobilization at work.</b>

12:32.400 --> 12:33.990
<b><i>My plan...</i></b>

12:34.380 --> 12:38.430
<b><i>If all of my ploys are blocked, 
I can't do anything.</i></b>

12:39.250 --> 12:42.060
<b>No, we're not done. It isn't over yet!</b>

12:42.060 --> 12:44.400
<b><i>But what are you going to do now?</i></b>

12:48.940 --> 12:50.000
<b>Okay.</b>

12:50.990 --> 12:52.940
<b><i>I can't blame Himeji for being worried.</i></b>

12:53.460 --> 12:55.460
<b><i>Even if I take the train to grab the 17,</i></b>

12:55.460 --> 12:58.470
<b><i>there's a very good chance 
Kugasaki will beat me to it.</i></b>

12:58.930 --> 12:59.980
<b>In that case...</b>

13:04.550 --> 13:06.710
<b>Oh. Hey there, Shinohara.</b>

13:06.710 --> 13:08.130
<b>Urasaka-senpai?</b>

13:17.600 --> 13:23.200
<b>Thank Headmistress Ichinose or whoever
for getting me the business permit.</b>

13:23.470 --> 13:28.260
<b><i>Arranging for a motorcycle to be used as 
public transport? She sure thought ahead.</i></b>

13:28.260 --> 13:30.720
<b>Anyway, I'm out. Good luck, Shinohara.</b>

13:30.720 --> 13:31.630
<b>Yeah, thank—</b>

13:34.500 --> 13:36.110
<b>...you very much.</b>

13:37.890 --> 13:42.290
<b><i>The 17 card is apparently 
on the second or third floor.</i></b>

13:42.290 --> 13:42.880
<b>Okay.</b>

13:43.290 --> 13:44.040
<b>Huh?</b>

13:45.070 --> 13:46.810
<b>Are you kidding me?</b>

13:48.660 --> 13:50.260
<b>Is this even allowed?</b>

13:53.140 --> 13:54.440
<b>A little more...</b>

13:58.680 --> 13:59.400
<b>Got it!</b>

14:05.530 --> 14:06.030
<b>Now Collecting</b>

14:06.030 --> 14:06.990
<b>Now Collecting</b>

14:06.990 --> 14:08.530
<b>Now Collecting</b>

14:07.000 --> 14:08.520
<b>Wow, meow!</b>

14:08.530 --> 14:10.530
<b>Now Collecting</b>

14:10.870 --> 14:14.090
<b>Kugasaki-senpai just 
got another card, meow!</b>

14:14.090 --> 14:17.830
<b>And Shinohara-kun hasn't picked up
 any for quite a while, meow!</b>

14:17.830 --> 14:20.030
<b>He's in a real, real, real tight spot, meow!</b>

14:25.210 --> 14:26.000
<b>Himeji?</b>

14:28.490 --> 14:29.980
<b><i>What's the situation now?</i></b>

14:29.980 --> 14:34.230
<b><i>If Kugasaki has already collected 
18 cards, I have no chance.</i></b>

14:34.230 --> 14:35.430
<b>Ow!</b>

14:35.770 --> 14:40.160
<b>But it's too soon to give up. I'm the 
only one using Numerical Adjustment.</b>

14:40.160 --> 14:42.520
<b>With a third card, 
I might have the advantage...</b>

14:42.520 --> 14:44.200
<b>It's not gonna happen, dummy.</b>

14:45.850 --> 14:49.530
<b>The only place you need to go 
right now is the emergency room.</b>

14:52.970 --> 14:54.950
<b>You really think I can do that?</b>

14:56.590 --> 14:58.290
<b>I still have to find her.</b>

14:59.280 --> 15:03.580
<b>She always found ways of sneaking me out 
and taking me new places to play.</b>

15:04.030 --> 15:08.800
<b>Until I see her again, 
there's no way I'm gonna lose.</b>

15:09.430 --> 15:12.610
<b>Plus, if I lose, there'll be
consequences for you, too.</b>

15:14.550 --> 15:17.840
<b>Don't you need to keep playing 
the kidnapped heiress's double?</b>

15:18.260 --> 15:21.550
<b>You and I are in the same position, 
Saionji. We're accomplices.</b>

15:23.650 --> 15:27.120
<b>Let me protect your lie, too.</b>

15:33.310 --> 15:35.110
<b>It was a lie.</b>

15:35.110 --> 15:35.950
<b>Huh?</b>

15:35.950 --> 15:39.750
<b>That stuff about Sarasa 
getting kidnapped. It's all a lie!</b>

15:40.270 --> 15:42.220
<b>Wait. What do you mean?</b>

15:43.130 --> 15:45.710
<b>"I want to go to a normal school."</b>

15:45.710 --> 15:48.150
<b>That was Sarasa's wish.</b>

15:49.020 --> 15:52.840
<b>I made it look like she was kidnapped 
and took her to the mainland.</b>

15:53.070 --> 15:55.790
<b>You defied the Saionji family all by yourself?</b>

15:55.790 --> 15:59.000
<b>Yeah, that's right. I <i>am</i> a genius, you know.</b>

15:59.000 --> 16:01.180
<b>Shouldn't you have 
at least brought Himeji in—</b>

16:01.180 --> 16:02.950
<b>How could I, idiot?!</b>

16:03.600 --> 16:07.830
<b>The lie is set to be revealed 
when Sarasa graduates in two years.</b>

16:07.830 --> 16:10.750
<b>How <i>could</i> I drag Yuki 
into something like that?</b>

16:11.000 --> 16:13.180
<b>So you should just give up!</b>

16:13.180 --> 16:16.800
<b>We can still tell them 
it was all my fault.</b>

16:17.470 --> 16:21.340
<b>I fooled you with my lies. 
You're just a victim.</b>

16:21.960 --> 16:25.000
<b>Yeah, now it finally makes sense.</b>

16:25.260 --> 16:26.000
<b>Huh?</b>

16:26.310 --> 16:28.770
<b>To make your friend's dream come true,</b>

16:28.770 --> 16:31.650
<b>you fooled both Academy Island 
and the Saionji family.</b>

16:31.650 --> 16:35.240
<b>That's insane, but I can relate. 
I think it's pretty awesome.</b>

16:36.270 --> 16:37.790
<b>Totally my type.</b>

16:38.210 --> 16:39.980
<b>Huh? What?</b>

16:40.770 --> 16:41.970
<b>What do you mean?</b>

16:45.200 --> 16:48.720
<b>I'm saying, let's keep this act up
 for a little while longer.</b>

16:50.130 --> 16:51.490
<b>Shinohara...</b>

16:51.490 --> 16:52.610
<b>Master!</b>

16:54.310 --> 16:55.460
<b>Are you injured?</b>

16:56.060 --> 16:58.410
<b>Himeji, bring me up to speed.</b>

16:58.410 --> 17:03.400
<b>R-Right. Kugasaki-sama has 
collected a total of 16 cards.</b>

17:03.400 --> 17:07.430
<b>The location data for the 
remaining two has yet to be revealed.</b>

17:03.410 --> 17:07.420
<b>Self-Made Holy Knight Brigade</b>

17:03.410 --> 17:07.420
<b>Self-Made Holy Knight Brigade</b>

17:07.430 --> 17:11.190
<b>In that case, it's pretty certain 
I'll end up with two. All right...</b>

17:12.320 --> 17:14.790
<b>We need a way to turn this around.</b>

17:15.150 --> 17:18.840
<b>Please hold on a second. 
You are not giving up?</b>

17:18.840 --> 17:21.820
<b>The Company's ploys 
have all been blocked,</b>

17:21.820 --> 17:24.510
<b>but you think you can win 
in this hopeless situation?</b>

17:25.130 --> 17:26.280
<b>Of course.</b>

17:29.280 --> 17:34.440
<b>Master, thank you so much
 for listening to my wish.</b>

17:34.440 --> 17:36.480
<b>What do you mean "your wish," Yuki?</b>

17:37.950 --> 17:39.900
<b>Don't worry about it, Rina.</b>

17:40.400 --> 17:43.440
<b>Well, then. I will start 
brainstorming as well.</b>

17:43.440 --> 17:47.220
<b>If I backed out while my master
and best friend were still trying,</b>

17:47.220 --> 17:48.380
<b>I would be a failure as a maid.</b>

17:48.380 --> 17:52.090
<b>B-Best friend? Shucks, Yuki.</b>

17:53.010 --> 17:55.510
<b><i>Numerical Adjustment</i></b>

17:53.010 --> 17:55.510
<b>Can change numerical values that have a function in the game</b>

17:53.010 --> 17:55.510
<b><i>Penetrate Defense</i></b>

17:53.010 --> 17:55.510
<b>Temporarily disable opponent's defense ability</b>

17:53.010 --> 17:55.510
<b><i>Display Bug</i></b>

17:53.010 --> 17:55.510
<b>Make opponent's display bug out</b>

17:53.010 --> 17:55.510
<b><i>Blackout</i></b>

17:53.010 --> 17:55.510
<b>Make a selected area pitch-black, obscuring the opponent's vision</b>

17:53.010 --> 17:55.510
<b><i>Inability Barrier</i></b>

17:53.010 --> 17:55.510
<b>Create a wall that shuts down the opponent's attacks</b>

17:53.010 --> 17:55.510
<b><i>Afterthought</i></b>

17:53.730 --> 17:55.000
<b>Hey, Saionji...</b>

17:55.000 --> 17:55.500
<b>Hm?</b>

17:55.900 --> 17:58.510
<b>Is there an ability that 
lets you change the rules?</b>

17:58.510 --> 18:05.020
<b><i>Rule Breaker</i></b>

17:58.510 --> 18:05.020
<b><i>Can rewrite game rules</i></b>

17:58.510 --> 18:05.020
<b><i>Installation Requirements: 6 Stars or Above</i></b>

17:58.890 --> 18:01.990
<b>Yeah. The most famous one is Rule Breaker.</b>

18:01.990 --> 18:05.020
<b>But it's only for people 
ranked Six Stars or above.</b>

18:05.020 --> 18:09.600
<b>I don't care about that. 
The important thing is it exists.</b>

18:11.050 --> 18:14.570
<b>You've thought of something 
really devious, haven't you?</b>

18:14.970 --> 18:19.070
<b>To pull it off, I'll need to 
update the Display Bug effects.</b>

18:19.510 --> 18:22.310
<b>If we focus all Company resources, 
it might just be possible.</b>

18:23.010 --> 18:23.700
<b>No...</b>

18:24.770 --> 18:26.730
<b>I will make sure it happens in time!</b>

18:27.310 --> 18:29.120
<b>He's just a simple Five Star.</b>

18:29.740 --> 18:32.740
<b>What am I even doing here
if I can't trick someone like that?</b>

18:33.740 --> 18:34.720
<b>Wow!</b>

18:33.930 --> 18:37.110
<b>Good luck, boss!</b>

18:34.720 --> 18:36.830
<b>Finish him off!</b>

18:36.830 --> 18:38.420
<b>Do it!</b>

18:38.420 --> 18:39.450
<b>Hiroto!</b>

18:39.450 --> 18:40.910
<b>Kugasaki!</b>

18:40.300 --> 18:42.850
<b>You toppled my goddess before,</b>

18:42.850 --> 18:46.090
<b>so while I was wary of you,
I also expected great things.</b>

18:46.090 --> 18:50.060
<b>But there is no way you can win the 
three rounds you need to defeat me.</b>

18:51.220 --> 18:56.030
<b>Well, Shinohara? Rather than engage 
in an extremely dull reveal phase,</b>

18:56.030 --> 18:58.070
<b>I recommend you yield.</b>

18:58.350 --> 18:59.700
<b>Maybe you're right.</b>

19:06.580 --> 19:08.580
<b>And so, victory is mine!</b>

19:09.030 --> 19:12.580
<b>W-Well, then! I will now 
announce the winner, meow!</b>

19:12.930 --> 19:17.710
<b>So that's that! The winner of 
the Self-Made 27-Form Game is...</b>

19:18.090 --> 19:19.470
<b><i>We're running out of time!</i></b>

19:19.470 --> 19:20.950
<b>Kugasa—</b>

19:20.150 --> 19:21.900
<b>Hold on a minute, referee.</b>

19:20.950 --> 19:21.900
<b>Meow?</b>

19:22.430 --> 19:23.680
<b>What's going on?</b>

19:23.680 --> 19:24.660
<b>What happened?</b>

19:24.920 --> 19:28.880
<b>Hey, Kugasaki, do you know what 
condition needs to be met to end the game?</b>

19:29.140 --> 19:31.520
<b>Are you trying to mock me?</b>

19:31.520 --> 19:33.900
<b>Obviously, it's to win 
during the reveal phase.</b>

19:35.160 --> 19:40.270
<b>That's the condition to <i>win</i> the game. 
I mean the condition to <i>end</i> the game.</b>

19:40.590 --> 19:45.090
<b>To merely end the game, 
either both players run out of cards...</b>

19:45.090 --> 19:46.030
<b><i>This is all I've got.</i></b>

19:46.330 --> 19:48.840
<b>...or one side takes more rounds and wins.</b>

19:49.380 --> 19:52.950
<b>What's the matter? 
Stalling like this is pathetic.</b>

19:53.750 --> 19:55.580
<b><i>I got your back, Hiro-kyun!</i></b>

19:57.370 --> 20:00.130
<b>You're totally missing the point, dude.</b>

20:00.960 --> 20:01.950
<b>Of what?</b>

20:03.380 --> 20:05.390
<b><i>of cards, the reveal phase ends</i></b>

20:03.380 --> 20:05.390
<b><i>and the player with more round points becomes 
the victor of the Self-Made 27-Form Game.</i></b>

20:03.390 --> 20:03.720
<b><i>If both sides run out</i></b>

20:03.390 --> 20:03.720
<b><i>If both sides run out</i></b>

20:03.390 --> 20:05.390
<b><i>Conditions to End the Reveal Phase</i></b>

20:03.720 --> 20:05.390
<b><i>If either side runs out</i></b>

20:03.720 --> 20:05.390
<b><i>If either side runs out</i></b>

20:05.390 --> 20:07.690
<b>What? What's happening?</b>

20:07.690 --> 20:11.140
<b>The rule was supposed to say
"if <i>both</i> sides run out of cards"!</b>

20:11.140 --> 20:14.060
<b>Maybe it was, but that's what it says now.</b>

20:14.060 --> 20:15.980
<b>Either you were mistaken,</b>

20:16.470 --> 20:18.440
<b>or maybe somebody tweaked things.</b>

20:18.440 --> 20:20.230
<b>Unbelievable! You scumbag!</b>

20:20.230 --> 20:23.020
<b>Did you use Rule Breaker?!</b>

20:24.720 --> 20:29.270
<b>According to the <i>current</i> rules, since I ran 
out of cards, the reveal phase is over.</b>

20:29.270 --> 20:31.120
<b>The score's 0-0. We're even.</b>

20:31.120 --> 20:34.530
<b>Y-You smug piece of trash!</b>

20:34.530 --> 20:36.960
<b>All right, let's start the battle afresh.</b>

20:37.300 --> 20:41.730
<b>But you must recall that with Emergency 
Mobilization, I can change my team members.</b>

20:41.730 --> 20:43.980
<b>The advantage remains with me!</b>

20:44.210 --> 20:46.970
<b>Oh boy. You're really making me work for it.</b>

20:47.410 --> 20:48.940
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

20:49.300 --> 20:51.630
<b>With this, I've just won.</b>

20:52.270 --> 20:53.150
<b>What?</b>

20:56.150 --> 20:57.850
<b>So you didn't discard it?</b>

20:57.850 --> 21:02.030
<b>But since I have zero cards, 
that will have no effect on the score.</b>

21:02.030 --> 21:04.520
<b>You're the one who used 
Rule Breaker to change the rules!</b>

21:05.210 --> 21:07.580
<b>Change the rules, huh?</b>

21:07.580 --> 21:09.030
<b>That was just your imagination.</b>

21:09.340 --> 21:10.850
<b>My imagination?</b>

21:10.850 --> 21:15.050
<b>All I did was make it look that way 
by changing the text on the screen.</b>

21:15.040 --> 21:16.540
<b>and the player with more round points becomes
 the victor of the Self-Made 27-Form Game.</b>

21:15.040 --> 21:16.790
<b>Conditions to End the Reveal Phase</b>

21:15.040 --> 21:16.790
<b>If both sides run out of cards, the reveal phase ends</b>

21:15.340 --> 21:16.270
<b>Huh?!</b>

21:16.540 --> 21:16.670
<b>and the player with more round points becomes
 the victor of the Self-Made 27-Form Game.</b>

21:17.160 --> 21:19.950
<b>What's this, meow? Then, the reveal phase...</b>

21:19.950 --> 21:23.540
<b>...is obviously not over yet. 
So then, once again...</b>

21:26.050 --> 21:30.020
<b>And you? Oh, right. 
You don't have a single card.</b>

21:32.770 --> 21:35.390
<b>That's why, like I just told you...</b>

21:37.160 --> 21:39.910
<b>That means I win, flunky.</b>

21:40.350 --> 21:42.840
<b>Wow!</b>

21:42.840 --> 21:44.480
<b>He's the best!</b>

21:49.530 --> 21:51.740
<b>A brilliant victory, Master.</b>

21:52.710 --> 21:55.130
<b>I thought you were amazing.</b>

21:58.500 --> 22:01.500
<b>District 4

University
Hospital\h</b>

22:05.010 --> 22:06.200
<b>Shinohara!</b>

22:06.710 --> 22:10.140
<b>Jeez. You aren't supposed to 
sneak out of your hospital room.</b>

22:10.140 --> 22:11.970
<b>Yo. Come to check on me?</b>

22:11.970 --> 22:18.240
<b>N-No! I was just passing and remembered 
I had something to say to you.</b>

22:18.620 --> 22:19.690
<b>Something to say?</b>

22:19.990 --> 22:22.040
<b>First of all, about your skill.</b>

22:22.040 --> 22:24.510
<b>You've been hiding your 
true abilities, haven't you?</b>

22:24.510 --> 22:28.820
<b>If I'd been in your place, 
I don't know if I could've won that game.</b>

22:29.190 --> 22:30.070
<b>And what else?</b>

22:30.070 --> 22:30.710
<b>Huh?</b>

22:30.710 --> 22:33.440
<b>"First of all" means 
there's something else, right?</b>

22:33.750 --> 22:34.720
<b>Yeah...</b>

22:34.720 --> 22:40.170
<b>The other thing is, like, after I told you
the real Sarasa hadn't been kidnapped,</b>

22:40.170 --> 22:42.450
<b>you suddenly got motivated.</b>

22:42.460 --> 22:45.030
<b>Hm? Well, I guess you're right there.</b>

22:45.030 --> 22:46.330
<b>Well, about that...</b>

22:46.930 --> 22:50.840
<b>What was all that about? 
The "my type" stuff.</b>

22:50.840 --> 22:52.670
<b>Okay, sure. Got it.</b>

22:53.110 --> 22:55.180
<b>Himeji says I can head on home.</b>

22:55.180 --> 22:57.250
<b>Oh, my bad. Um, what were you saying?</b>

22:57.250 --> 22:59.090
<b>I didn't say a thing.</b>

23:01.780 --> 23:04.530
<b>H-Hey! Hey! I'm wounded here!</b>

23:04.530 --> 23:07.600
<b>Yeah, right. A wounded person 
lounging around on the roof?</b>

23:08.560 --> 23:10.750
<b>Not just your injuries...</b>

23:11.640 --> 23:16.040
<b>Your lie also didn't get out and 
you weren't kicked off the island.</b>

23:16.490 --> 23:18.490
<b>I'm really glad it all worked out.</b>

23:20.020 --> 23:22.010
<b>Who do you think I am?</b>

23:22.280 --> 23:24.790
<b>I'm the Seven Star, 
the strongest on the island.</b>

23:28.290 --> 23:31.390
<b>That wasn't much of a tight spot for me.</b>

23:35.450 --> 23:38.550
<b>You really are a big fat liar.</b>
